      55.28,
      511.68,
      549.93,
      569.15
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS by Order made under Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (Revised Edition 1956), as amended by Acts, Nos. 14 and 62 of 1957, 14 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 read with Industrial Disputes (Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 dated 20.04.2021 and published in the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka Extraordinary No. 2224/51 dated 24.04.2021 of the Industrial Dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour dated 09.04.2021.",
